{
 "page": "MarioGolfRecompiled.html",
 "header": [
  "The courses past Toad Highlands for N64Recomp-browser's tools/record_shaders.mjs --add, into src/rt64_shaders.txt",
  "beside tools/shader_plan.json's sections. A new save has only Toad Highlands open, so each load opens them all as",
  "the GameShark's Have All Courses does (0xFFFF at 0x80130CEE, written every 50 ms), then takes the main menu's",
  "ONE, the first golfer and a Tournament with A, turns the course select right once a course (the selected one is the byte",
  "at 0x801323B6: Koopa Cup, Shy Guy International, Yoshi Championship, Boo Classic, Mario Open), and plays the course's",
  "first hole: its flyover, three shots from the tee with the pause menu between, on the game's clock",
  "(tools/shader_survey.js). Its last section, mini_golf, takes the play modes' Mini-Golf (five presses right) in place of a",
  "Tournament: a course of its own, whose hole is overlay 2 where the others' is 11."
 ],
